  "consts": [
   "core/anf_store.py - A&F Commitment Store + KI backfill.\n\nA single A&F tech pack spreads across N PO PDFs (each referencing its own\n``Commitment:`` number) and M Commitment PDFs (one commitment per file). The PO\nPDFs lack the Key Item (KI) / Mill / Fabric, which only exist on the Commitment\nsheet. This module holds the parsed Commitment records and backfills them onto the\nPO entities by ``Commitment:`` number.\n\nKeying: the user confirmed a Tech Pack can carry several KIs, so the join key MUST\nbe the Commitment # (unique per KI), never the Tech Pack #.\n",
